# REQUIRES: python-api, cuda, torch
# A writable borrow of a Python simulation with the groups
# (D245, #270): a commit of the cell and the positions against
# a simulation compiled there, and the refusal of a cell whose least edge
# is below the pairlist distance over 0.999 (D242), which an orthorhombic
# cell did not reach before; the matrix takes that cell.
# Inputs/python_groups.py.
# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir -p %t
# RUN: %torch_python %S/Inputs/python_groups.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide mdir %t borrow Double | FileCheck %s -DP=Double
# RUN: %torch_python %S/Inputs/python_groups.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide mdir %t borrow Mixed | FileCheck %s -DP=Mixed
# CHECK: borrow [[P]] passed
